# SS-12 - Investigate Upstox, Zerodha and FYERS data
Workstream ID: SS-12
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/12
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M4
Dependencies: SS-03

## Purpose
Qualify the strongest documented broker-backed alternatives to initial free daily access.

## Tasks
- [ ] Upstox: V3 history, instrument master, auth/session, BSE and expired/Plus boundaries.
- [ ] Zerodha: Connect data subscription, instruments, history windows and continuous futures.
- [ ] FYERS: Standard/Prime history, quotas, NSE/BSE entitlement and current data fees.
- [ ] For each, execute the common eight-step qualification in docs/data-providers.md.
- [ ] Produce separate go/no-go receipts; implement only an entitled read-only adapter.

## Acceptance criteria
- Current official terms, actual account entitlement, adjustments and costs are recorded per option.
- No order endpoints, account opening or subscriptions activated without separate authority.

## Completion evidence
- Official documentation/pricing comparison exists in docs/data-providers.md.
- Account-level qualification and adapter implementation not started.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Completed desk-research shortlist; retained all three future investigations.
